in; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">արշալոյսը</span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ansi-language: HY; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">երբ</span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ansi-language: HY; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">մենք</span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ansi-language: HY; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">ճանապարհին</span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ansi-language: HY; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">կը</span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ansi-language: HY; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">կտրէինք</span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ansi-language: HY; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">Դաշտի,</span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ansi-language: HY; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">սիրելի</span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ansi-language: HY; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">Դաշտի</span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ansi-language: HY; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">շէն</span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ansi-language: HY; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">հայ</span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ansi-language: HY; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">գիւղերը։</span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ansi-language: HY; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">Սիրելի</span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ansi-language: HY; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">Արսէն,</span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ansi-language: HY; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">անհուն</span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ansi-language: HY; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">վիշտը</span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ansi-language: HY; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">կը</span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ansi-language: HY; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">ծանրանայ</span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ansi-language: HY; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">կրծքումս</span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ansi-language: HY; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">երբ</span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ansi-language: HY; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">կը</span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ansi-language: HY; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">գիտակցեմ</span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ansi-language: HY; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: cambria, serif; mso-ascii-theme